# The Trilium server release that awm serves (install.md R115 item 4): a tarball
# that a release of our fork (projects/trilium on mizar) built with
# apps/server/scripts/release-fork.sh. It stays in mizar's <AWM_DIR>/artifacts,
# and awm's deploy pushes it to each push node that names an artifacts directory
# (deploy.toml § artifacts). Bump all three together, then deploy awm.
